        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00251:alt:fig-00003-alt",
          "text": "Cycloheptene reacts with meta-chloroperoxybenzoic acid where dichloromethane acts as the solvent to yield 1,2-epoxycycloheptane and meta-chlorobenzoic acid."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_18_05_003.jpg",
