        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00251:alt:fig-00004-alt",
          "text": "Cyclohexene reacts with chlorine and water to yield trans-2-chlorocyclohexanol, followed by its conversion to 1,2-epoxycyclohexane via an intermediate with sodium hydroxide and water."
